  "result": "Excellent! All 39 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**addLine(invoice, { sku, qty }):**\n- Validates invoice has `status: 'draft'` (returns `NOT_DRAFT` otherwise)\n- Validates qty is a positive integer (returns `QTY_INVALID`)\n- Validates SKU exists in catalogue (returns `UNKNOWN_SKU`)\n- If SKU is new, adds it with enriched data from catalogue\n- If SKU already exists, increases its qty\n- Never mutates the input invoice\n\n**removeLine(invoice, sku):**\n- Validates invoice has `status: 'draft'` (returns `NOT_DRAFT`)\n- Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if SKU isn't on invoice\n- Returns `NO_LINES` if it would remove the last line\n- Returns new invoice with that line removed\n- Never mutates the input invoice\n\n**Error codes added:**\n- `NOT_DRAFT`: This operation is only allowed on draft invoices\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: No line with that SKU on this invoice\n\n**New tests (13):** Cover status validation, qty/SKU validation, adding/updating lines, removing lines, preventing last-line removal, and immutability.",
